{"id":8928892,"html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann/ops-transformer/merge_requests/9117","number":9117,"state":"merged","title":"fix(flash_attn): 修复 BAND 模式 MergeMask loopCount 越界写导致精度失败","url":"https://api.gitcode.com/api/v5/repos/cann/ops-transformer/pulls/9117","issue_url":"https://api.gitcode.com/api/v5/repos/cann/ops-transformer/pulls/9117/issues","body":"## 描述\nBAND 模式 (mask_mode=4) 下 MergeMask 函数中 halfS1RealSize + 1 导致 loopCount 越界，MergeBand 多写 1 整行 mask 数据到 UB buffer 之外，破坏相邻 buffer 数据，产生精度失败。\n\n## 改动\n- attenmask_gs1.h MergeMask：将 halfS1RealSizeLoop = halfS1RealSize + 1 改为 ceil 除法 (halfS1RealSizeLoop + rowNumEachLoop - 1) / rowNumEachLoop，在所有 s2BaseSize 下正确计算 loopCount，消除越界写\n\n## 关联的Issue\n#3923\n\n## 测试\n- 复现 case：B=1 N1=20 N2=4 S1=31 S2=112384 mask_mode=4 win_left=26755 win_right=0 PA_BNBD\n- 修复前：MaxAbsErr=182.42 FailRatio=1.67% FAIL\n- 修复后：MaxAbsErr=0.00225 FailRatio=0.38% PASS\n\n## 类型标签\n- [x] \uD83D\uDC1B Bug 修复\n- [ ] ✨ 新特性\n- [ ] ⚡ 性能优化\n- [ ] ♻️ 重构\n- [ ] \uD83E\uDDEA 测试\n- [ ] \uD83D\uDCE6 构建/CI\n- [ ] \uD83D\uDD27 配置变更\n- [ ] \uD83D\uDCDD 文档更新\n- [ ] ⬆️ 依赖升级\n- [ ] \uD83D\uDD12 安全修复\n- [ ] \uD83E\uDDF9 代码清理\n- [ ] ❓ 其他，请描述：","assignees_number":5,"assignees":[{"id":"68d55468c9e33e3d8f4119c6","login":"Andy-lb","name":"Andy-lb","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/Andy-lb","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"68832881c8d5363aeb8700a4","login":"gitcode-chenjiao","name":"chenjiao","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/gitcode-chenjiao","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"687871f1fc42115893adcd09","login":"jiangtao_rts","name":"jiangtao","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/jiangtao_rts","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"689ae799edeee41e78b94859","login":"hanxiaolong","name":"shane","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/hanxiaolong","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"68d502180329437872e54496","login":"gcw_kUomxQ2l","name":"liulun0308","avatar_url":"","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/gcw